{"id":"example_1","text":"床前明月光，疑是地上霜。举头望明月，低头思故乡。","dynasty":"Tang","spans":[{"start":2,"end":4,"label":"Moon"},{"start":17,"end":19,"label":"Moon"},{"start":22,"end":23,"label":"Longing"}]}
{"id":"example_2","text":"渭城朝雨浥轻尘，客舍青青柳色新。劝君更尽一杯酒，西出阳关无故人。","dynasty":"Tang","spans":[{"start":22,"end":23,"label":"Wine"}]}
{"id":"example_3","text":"花间一壶酒，独酌无相亲。举杯邀明月，对影成三人。","dynasty":"Tang","spans":[{"start":0,"end":1,"label":"Flower"},{"start":4,"end":5,"label":"Wine"},{"start":17,"end":19,"label":"Moon"}]}
